1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,685
我想走到这个世界允许的最远。
I wanted to get as far from home as the world allows.

2
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:08,785
第 1 天，北京，0 公里。
Day 1. Beijing. 0 kilometres.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,391
伊斯坦布尔，7000 公里。
Istanbul. 7,000 kilometres.

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:18,040
巴黎，8200。还不够远。
Paris. 8,200. Not far enough.

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:21,260
然后是布宜诺斯艾利斯，19000。
Then Buenos Aires. 19,000.

6
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:27,463
在一个圆的世界上，差不多已经走到头了。
On a round world, that is almost as far as you can go.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,536
从那儿起，哪条路都通向家。
And from there, every road leads home.

8
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:35,238
39600 公里之后，
39,600 kilometres later,

9
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:39,796
又是北京，0 公里。
Beijing again. 0 kilometres.

10
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:47,456
原来世界的另一头，只是绕远路回家。
It turns out, the far side of the world is just the long way home.
